      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im prepping for a law moot court competition and i'm stuck on a debate about executive privilege vs congressional oversight. basically, in the context of modern governance, is the expansion of executive privilege a necessary protection for the presidency or a dangerous erosion of checks and balances? pick the stronger legal position for me so i can focus my research.",
